{"id":"barzelletta","lemma":"barzelletta","pos":"noun","rank":4283,"glosses":["joke (amusing story)","a 15th century dance song composed of loose septenaries and octosyllables"],"ipa":"/bar.d͡zelˈlet.ta/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/8/85/LL-Q652_%28ita%29-LangPao-barzelletta.wav/LL-Q652_%28ita%29-LangPao-barzelletta.wav.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"barzellette"},"examples":[{"text":"Questa è una barzelletta.","en":"This is a joke.","words":[{"g":"this, this one, these","l":"questo"},{"g":"is","l":"essere"},{"g":"a","l":"uno"},null]},{"text":"Quella dovrebbe essere una barzelletta?","en":"Is that supposed to be a joke?","words":[{"g":"that one","l":"quello"},{"g":"to owe","l":"dovere"},{"g":"to be"},{"g":"a","l":"uno"},null]},{"text":"Non conosco molte barzellette.","en":"I don't know a lot of jokes.","words":[{"g":"not"},{"g":"to know","l":"conoscere"},{"g":"much, very much, a lot","l":"molto"},null]},{"text":"Amo le barzellette.","en":"I love jokes.","words":[{"g":"to love, to like","l":"amare"},{"g":"the / to her"},null]},{"text":"Perché hai raccontato quella barzelletta?","en":"Why did you tell that joke?","words":[{"g":"why / because"},{"g":"have","l":"avere"},{"g":"to tell","l":"raccontare"},{"g":"that one","l":"quello"},null]}]}